{"id":"abccf2ad279d17e6","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-mostrobustbounds.md","title":"Feasibility and zero cost of most robust extension","display":"thm-mostrobustbounds — Feasibility and zero cost of most robust extension","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-mostrobustbounds","aliases":["27-thm-mostrobustbounds"],"display":"thm-mostrobustbounds — Feasibility and zero cost of most robust extension","depends_on":["[[27-df-mostrobust]]","[[27-df-missingextensions]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.5.1, MRE(C); local consequences","source_printed_pages":"553","source_pdf_pages":"577","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-mostrobustbounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-mostrobustbounds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mostrobustbounds — Feasibility and zero cost of most robust extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9359527ad4f719e2\" href=\"?note=9359527ad4f719e2\" title=\"27-df-mostrobust\">27-df-mostrobust</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed82ee57f6aa99b2\" href=\"?note=ed82ee57f6aa99b2\" title=\"27-df-missingextensions\">27-df-missingextensions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.5.1, MRE(C); local consequences"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"553"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"577"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F)\\in\\mathrm{pBmb}_n\">\\((\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F)\\in\\mathrm{pBmb}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；最稳健扩张、完全稳健和一致扩张见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9359527ad4f719e2\" href=\"?note=9359527ad4f719e2\" title=\"27-df-mostrobust\">27-df-mostrobust</a>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\mathrm{AS}_n(\\widetilde T\\cup\\widetilde F)\">\\(A=\\mathrm{AS}_n(\\widetilde T\\cup\\widetilde F)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MRE}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{MRE}_n\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9359527ad4f719e2\" href=\"?note=9359527ad4f719e2\" title=\"27-df-mostrobust\">27-df-mostrobust</a> 的最小固定位置接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FRE}_n,\\mathrm{CE}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FRE}_n,\\mathrm{CE}_n\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed82ee57f6aa99b2\" href=\"?note=ed82ee57f6aa99b2\" title=\"27-df-missingextensions\">27-df-missingextensions</a> 的接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{CE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{CE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(\\emptyset,\\emptyset)\\in\\mathrm{MRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(\\emptyset,\\emptyset)\\in\\mathrm{MRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall(Q,\\alpha)\\in\\mathrm{MRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\;(0\\leq|Q|\\leq|A|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall(Q,\\alpha)\\in\\mathrm{MRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\;(0\\leq|Q|\\leq|A|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§12.5.1 Problem MRE(C)，印刷页 553 / PDF 第 577 页；本条为定义的本地推论。若有一致全赋值，固定全部 A 后不再有缺失位，所以可行；若部分固定后存在完全稳健函数，将部分赋值任意延伸到 A，仍得原始样本的一致扩张。有限可行对集合有最小 |Q|。零代价只可能 Q=∅，其唯一赋值是空函数，而不固定任何位恰是原 pBmb 的完全稳健要求。一般证明如上；无算法时间复杂度主张。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-mostrobust","status":"resolved","id":"9359527ad4f719e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-mostrobust]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-missingextensions","status":"resolved","id":"ed82ee57f6aa99b2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-missingextensions]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-mostrobust","status":"resolved","id":"9359527ad4f719e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F)\\in\\mathrm{pBmb}_n$，$\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；最稳健扩张、完全稳健和一致扩张见 [[27-df-mostrobust]]。记 $A=\\mathrm{AS}_n(\\widetilde T\\cup\\widetilde F)$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-mostrobust","status":"resolved","id":"9359527ad4f719e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MRE}_n$ 使用 [[27-df-mostrobust]] 的最小固定位置接口；$\\mathrm{FRE}_n,\\mathrm{CE}_n$ 使用 [[27-df-missingextensions]] 的接口。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-missingextensions","status":"resolved","id":"ed82ee57f6aa99b2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MRE}_n$ 使用 [[27-df-mostrobust]] 的最小固定位置接口；$\\mathrm{FRE}_n,\\mathrm{CE}_n$ 使用 [[27-df-missingextensions]] 的接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F)\\in\\mathrm{pBmb}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\mathrm{AS}_n(\\widetilde T\\cup\\widetilde F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MRE}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FRE}_n,\\mathrm{CE}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{CE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(\\emptyset,\\emptyset)\\in\\mathrm{MRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall(Q,\\alpha)\\in\\mathrm{MRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\;(0\\leq|Q|\\leq|A|).","display":true}],"bytes":2177,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-479","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-mostrobustbounds|thm-mostrobustbounds — Feasibility and zero cost of most robust extension]]"}],"outgoing":["9359527ad4f719e2","ed82ee57f6aa99b2"]}